{"abstract":"Energikrise, klima og sundhed har fyldt det hele i valgkampen. Men ingen har talt om den forskning, der skal udvikle løsningerne. Uden forskning har lille Danmark dog ikke nogen chance. Så husk forskning og uddannelse, når du sætter krydset i morgen.","author_count":25,"contributors":["Wittrup Agger, Jane","Abou Hachem, Maher","Laustsen, Andreas H.","Damgaard, Rune Busk","Workman, Christopher","Dirac, Annette","Brix, Susanne","Morth, Jens Preben","Martinussen, Jan","Voldborg, Bjørn Gunnar","Holck, Jesper","Larsen, Thomas Ostenfeld","Jelsbak, Lars","Mateiu, Ramona Valentina","Pedersen, Lasse Ebdrup","Marcussen, Mette Haagen","Zeuner, Birgitte","Bentzon-Tilia, Mikkel","Emnéus, Jenny","Møller, Marie Sofie","Buell, Alexander K.","Schoof, Erwin M.","Seibold, Gerd M.","Sternberg, Claus","Christensen, Bjarke Bak"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-310309"],"filters":{"added":"2022-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"corresponding_author":["Wittrup Agger, Jane"],"level":"pop","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"und","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"vigtig grundforskning sker ikke af sig selv det skal prioriteres af politikere og vælgere","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dna","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.information.dk/debat/2022/10/vigtig-grundforskning-sker-prioriteres-politikere-vaelgere?lst_frnt&amp;fbclid=IwAR1y79-gebYsUamyJitnQMQeVRCPposJ1-tptzvwfl0e5T7xu7G95gZzbg0","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-310309","ids":["dtu-12fc6f37-ad7e-4623-bcba-4142d5c745fa"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Popular","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Local-1-1-70C9D10F7E9A890C492344DAC12B40AB"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology, DTU Carbohydrate Analysis Core","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology, Enzyme Technology","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Biotechnology and Biomedicine, Section for Protein Chemistry and Enzyme Technology, Lignin Biotechnology"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Jane Wittrup","key":"aggerpau","last":"Agger","locid":"c8d024fd-be76-4aa3-a266-0cbc3e2b36db","name":"Wittrup Agger, Jane","name_org":"Agger, Jane Wittrup","orcid":"0000-0002-7796-3089","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Maher Abou","key":"hachempau","last":"Hachem","locid":"a81cbffb-ca6f-44ca-8a7d-4211cea18ca1","name":"Abou Hachem, Maher","name_org":"Hachem, Maher Abou","orcid":"0000-0001-8250-1842","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Andreas Hougaard","key":"laustsenkielpau","last":"Laustsen-Kiel","locid":"0e4bb465-c620-461f-9970-29bad328cf8a","name":"Laustsen, Andreas H.","name_org":"Laustsen-Kiel, Andreas Hougaard","orcid":"0000-0001-6918-5574","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Rune Busk","key":"damgaardpau","last":"Damgaard","locid":"6545c183-b2cc-4bbe-8e4b-e60e8276dd26","name":"Damgaard, Rune Busk","orcid":"0000-0002-1709-6534","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"C