{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver resultaterne fra en kvantitativ dataindsamling blandt pædagogiske medarbejdere. Dataindsamlingen indgår som et led i projektet “A window of change: transformations of playful learning environments in kindergarten and primary school during Covid-19”.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Qvortrup, Ane","Enemark Lundtofte, Thomas","Christensen, Vibeke","Lomholt, Rune","Nielsen, Anni","Qvortrup, Lars","Wistoft, Karen","Clark, Aske"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-239571"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Corona","Dagtilbud","Early childhood","Legemiljøer","Pædagogiske aktiviteter","Samfund samtid","Trivsel"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genåbningen af børnehaver efter covid 000000000019 nedlukninger et personaleperspektiv datarapport pædagoger pædagogiske assistenter og medhjælpere fra dagtilbud","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_boernehavepersonale_kolding.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-239571","ids":["au-c134586e-0466-49b7-b63f-2eaa8d889116"],"keyword":["Corona","Dagtilbud","Early childhood","Legemiljøer","Pædagogiske aktiviteter","Samfund/samtid","Trivsel"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-CED27651C55D93B4DE7EB72A41F340C8"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_boernehavepersonale_kolding.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","coun