{"abstract":"Based on a field study, this paper presents an analysis of the ICT-driven agricultural initiative in Cambodia and shows how it may be understood as infrastructuring for value chain, for microcredit, and for capacity building. The paper considers the relational, connected, emerging, and intentional character of the initiative. In doing so, it outlines an approach to the investigation and conception of infrastructuring for smallholder farming in the Global South.","author_count":3,"contributors":["Ahsan, Hasib","Christensen, Lars Rune","Kitura, K"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382109"],"event":{"acronym":"C&T","title":"International Conference on Communities and Technologies"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Asia, East"],"country":["Hong Kong"],"glorg":["Agribuddy Ltd.","All Global Affiliations"],"keyword":["Capacity building","Global South farming","ICT driven agriculture","Infrastructuring","Value chain"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"agribuddy infrastructuring for smallholder farming in cambodia","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3461564.3461576","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382109","identifier":[{"id":"85109407557","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-3918fa3b-a409-4469-ba34-27ae15a6dc5e"],"keyword":["Capacity building","Global South farming","ICT-driven agriculture","Infrastructuring","Value chain"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-EDD5230F3B4778175A51FE6852EA4449"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3461564.3461576","vers