{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver resultaterne fra en kvantitativ dataindsamling blandt børnehavebørn og forældre. Dataindsamlingen indgår som en del i projektet “A window of change: transformations of playful learning environments in kindergarten and primary school during Covid-19”, som er finansieret af LEGO Fonden.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Qvortrup, Ane","Enemark Lundtofte, Thomas","Lomholt, Rune","Christensen, Vibeke","Nielsen, Anni","Qvortrup, Lars","Wistoft, Karen","Clark, Aske"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-145248"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Corona","Dagtilbud","Early childhood","Legemiljøer","Samfund samtid","Trivsel"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genåbning af børnehaver i kolding efter covid 000000000019 nedlukning i foråret 000000002020 et børne og forældreperspektiv datarapport børn og forældre i dagtilbud","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_boernehaveboernforaeldre_kolding_final.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-145248","ids":["au-1bc6b4af-be90-4a34-93d8-7ab92b6f96ad"],"keyword":["Corona","Early childhood","Legemiljøer","Samfund/samtid","Socio-emotionelle erfaringer","Trivsel","dagtilbud"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-7E407A61187DF0233BE823E9C3044B2C"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_boernehaveboernforaeldre_kolding_final.pdf","version":"Ot