{"abstract":"Denne rapport beskriver resultaterne fra anden kvantitative dataindsamling blandt lærere i Kolding i projektet “A window of change: transformations of playful learning environments in kindergarten and primary school during Covid-19”, som er finansieret af LEGO Foundation.","author_count":8,"contributors":["Qvortrup, Ane","Enemark Lundtofte, Thomas","Christensen, Vibeke","Lomholt, Rune","Nielsen, Anni","Qvortrup, Lars","Wistoft, Karen","Clark, Aske"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-248506"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Grundskole","Samfund samtid","Skole hjem samarbejde"],"level":"sci","mra":["hum"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"nr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"genåbning og ny nedlukning af skolerne i kolding efter covid000000000019 nedlukning i foråret 000000002020 et lærerperspektiv datarapport skolepersonale","src":["au"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU"],"type":"dr","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_skolepersonale_kolding_final.pdf","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-248506","ids":["au-d08bd2ee-f89d-4228-a7cb-028046570d04"],"keyword":["Grundskole","Samfund/samtid","Skole-hjem-samarbejde"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Humanities"],"noi":["Local-1-1-F98F7F16E9C8D324DB0BB79F17E7F154"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"rem","url":"https://www.sdu.dk/-/media/files/om_sdu/institutter/ikv/forskning/forskningsprojekter/genaabningsprojekt/fase+2_kolding/datarapport_skolepersonale_kolding_final.pdf","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["University of Southern Denmark (SDU)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, Danish School of Education, Danish School of Education - Educational Sociology, Emdrup"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Ane","key":"qvortrupanepau","last":"Qvortrup","name":"Qvortrup, Ane","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"enemarklundtoftethomaspau","last":"Enemark Lundtofte","name":"Enemark Lundtofte, Thomas","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Vibeke","key":"christensenvibekepau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Vibeke","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Rune","key":"lomholtrunepau","last":"Lomholt","name":"Lomholt, Rune","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anni","key":"nielsenannipau","last":"Nielsen","name":"Nielsen, Anni","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars","key":"qvortruplarspau","last":"Qvortrup","locid":"4098e515-bc89-4a5d-b743-535b090f76c7","name":"Qvortrup, Lars","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Karen","key":"wistoftkarenpau","last":"Wistoft","locid":"cbdab0a9-8516-45e9-84a3-ee963b7d3b1d","name":"Wistoft, Karen","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Aske","key":"clarkaskepau","last":"Clark","locid":"c571d18e-3bfa-45cb-918e-9f567fc5a47a","name":"Clark, Aske","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"pages":"50","place":"Odense","publisher":"Syddansk Universitet","status":"p"},"review":"No Review","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-d08bd2ee-f89d-4228-a7cb-028046570d04"],"src":["AU Aarhus University"],"title":"Genåbning og ny nedlukning af skolerne i Kolding efter Covid19-nedlukning i foråret 2020. Et lærerperspektiv : Datarapport - skolepersonale","type":"Report","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-248506","year":"2021","yearsub":"2021"}
{"abstract":"This paper draws attention to new complexities of deploying artificial intelligence (AI) to sensitive contexts, such as welfare allocation. AI is increasingly used in public administration with the promise of improving decision-making through predictive modelling. To accurately predict, it needs all the agreed criteria used as part of decisions, formal and informal. This paper empirically explores the informal classifications used by caseworkers to make unemployed welfare seekers 'fit' into the formal categories applied in a Danish job centre. Our findings show that these classifications are documentable, and hence traceable to AI. However, to the caseworkers, they are at odds with the stable explanations assumed by any bureaucratic recording system as they involve negotiated and situated judgments of people's character. Thus, for moral reasons, caseworkers find them ill-suited for formal representation and predictive …","author_count":4,"contributors":["Petersen, Anette","Christensen, Lars Rune","Harper, Richard","Hildebrandt, Thomas"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-384149"],"event":{"acronym":"CSCW","title":"ACM Conference on Computer Supported Cooperative Work"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"2-5 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["United Kingdom"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","Lancaster University"],"keyword":["Artificial intelligence","Informal Classifications","Predictive modelling","Public administration","Welfare Allocation"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"we would never write that down classifications of unemployed and data challenges for ai","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3449176","version":"Published Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-384149","identifier":[{"id":"85112686825","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-c4ada0ea-85f6-472a-a5ef-bf730a96f438"],"keyword":["Artificial Intelligence","Informal Classifications","Predictive Modelling","Public Administration","Welfare Allocation"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-8B14E853E6107E8BCE8D4A28386FC331"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","license":"Ikke-specificeret","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1145/3449176","version":"Published Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"gb","key":"lancaster university","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"Lancaster University","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Anette","key":"petersenpau","last":"Petersen","name":"Petersen, Anette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Richard","key":"harperpau","last":"Harper","name":"Harper, Richard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Thomas","key":"hildebrandtpau","last":"Hildebrandt","name":"Hildebrandt, Thomas","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1145/3449176","issn":["25730142"],"issue":"CSCW1","journal":"Proceedings of the ACM on Human-Computer Interaction","pag