{"abstract":"Actors in the building process are critically dependent on a corpus of written text that draws the distributed work tasks together. This paper introduces, on the basis of a field study, the concepts of corpus, intertext and intertextuality to the analysis of text in cooperative work practice. This paper shows that actors in the building process create intertext (connections) between complementary texts, in a particular situation and for a particular task. This has an integrating effect on the building process. Several types of intertextuality, including the complementary type, the intratextual type and the mediated type, may constitute the intertext of a particular task. By employing the concepts of corpus, intertext and intertextuality with respect to the study of the building process, this paper outlines an approach to the investigation of text in cooperative work.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382047"],"event":{"acronym":"ECSCW","end":"2015-09-23","place":"Olso, no","start":"2015-09-19","title":"European Conference on Computer Supported Cooperative Work","year":"2015"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","cluster_size":1,"keyword":["Cooperative work","Corpus","Intertext","Intertextuality","building process analysis"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"intertext on connecting text in the building process","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S01-000.00-382047","ids":["itu-34ed75b6-1582-4680-89f9-2c39348cd595"],"keyword":["building process analysis","cooperative work","corpus","intertext","intertextuality"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-3-42F6947D7D87EA61EC52B8299759FCD0"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice","The Department, Interdisciplinary Section"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"N","key":"boulusrødjepedh","last":"Boulus-Rødje","name":"Boulus-Rødje, N","rank":2,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"G","key":"ellingsenpedh","last":"Ellingsen","name":"Ellingsen, G","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"T","key":"bratteteigpedh","last":"Bratteteig","name":"Bratteteig, T","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"M","key":"aanestadpedh","last":"Aanestad","name":"Aanestad, M","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"P","key":"bjørnpedh","last":"Bjørn","name":"Bjørn, P","rank":6,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-3-319-20499-4_6","eisbn":["9783319204994"],"isbn":["9783319204987"],"pages":"103-121","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","title":"ECSCW 2015: Proceedings of the 14th European Conference on Computer Supported Cooperative Work (ECSCW), Oslo, 19 - 23 September, 2015","volume":"Part I"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-34ed75b6-1582-4680-89f9-2c39348cd595"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Intertext: On Connecting Text in the Building Process","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382047","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"In this chapter, we attempt to achieve a better understanding of how cooperative work is partly accomplished by virtue of the actors’ manipulation and control of causal relationships central to their material field of work. Previous CSCW studies have not focused extensively on causation in cooperative work (e.g. see Schmidt and Bannon 2013). Consequently, it is a challenge to find a conception of causation appropriate for the study of cooperative work. This chapter addresses this challenge.","author_count":6,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars R.","Bertelsen, Olav W."],"cuid":["S02-080.95-804171"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["No Matches Found"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["CSCW","Causal Relationships","Cooperative work","causation in collaborative environments","material field"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"a view of causation for cscw manipulation and control in the material field of work","src":["au","itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"id":"S02-080.95-804171","ids":["au-a3424ab5-51c1-47a1-90cc-bf2b315aa0bb","itu-528e61c2-c500-4d8f-a99a-cf51eb2b47d2"],"keyword":["CSCW","causal relationships","causation in collaborative environments","cooperative work","material field"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-571C0B3697EE9E540B15B9687FF343E8"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice","The Department, Interdisciplinary Section"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1},{"affno":"2","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Arts, School of Communication and Culture, School of Communication and Culture - Participatory Information Technology","Aarhus University, Natural Sciences, Department of Computer Science"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Olav W.","key":"bertelsenpau","last":"Bertelsen","locid":"bac4b6b1-9a73-4c1a-9b90-31a69af5b6b0","name":"Bertelsen, Olav W.","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Volker","key":"wulfpedh","last":"Wulf","name":"Wulf, Volker","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Volker","key":"wolfpedh","last":"Wolf","name":"Wolf, Volker","rank":3,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"Kjeld","key":"schmidtpedh","last":"Schmidt","name":"Schmidt, Kjeld","rank":4,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"},{"affno":"","first":"David","key":"randallpedh","last":"Randall","name":"Randall, David","rank":5,"role":"Editor of Host Publication","rolecode":"pedh"}],"pub":{"doi":"10.1007/978-1-4471-6720-4_8","eisbn":["9781447167204"],"isbn":["9781447167198"],"issn":["14311496"],"pages":"151-169","publisher":"Springer","series":"Computer Supported Cooperative Work Series","status":"p","title":"Designing Socially Embedded Technologies in the Real-World","volume":"Part II"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","search":{"DAF":["Aarhus University","All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["au-a3424ab5-51c1-47a1-90cc-bf2b315aa0bb","itu-528e61c2-c500-4d8f-a99a-cf51eb2b47d2"],"src":["AU Aarhus University","ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"A View of Causation for CSCW: Manipulation and Control in the Material Field of Work.","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-080.95-804171","year":"2015","yearsub":"2015"}
{"abstract":"Data from the first year of ESA's Swarm constellation mission are used to derive the Swarm Initial Field Model (SIFM), a new model of the Earth's magnetic field and its time variation. In addition to the conventional magnetic field observations provided by each of the three Swarm satellites, explicit advantage is taken of the constellation aspect by including East-West magnetic intensity gradient information from the lower satellite pair. Along-track differences in magnetic intensity provide further information concerning the North-South gradient. The SIFM static field shows excellent agreement (up to at least degree 60) with recent field models derived from CHAMP data, providing an initial validation of the quality of the Swarm magnetic measurements. Use of gradient data improves the determination of both the static field and its secular variation, with the mean misfit for East-West intensity differences between the lower satellite pair being only 0.12 nT.","author_count":11,"contributors":["Olsen, Nils","Hulot, Gauthier","Lesur, Vincent","Finlay, Chris","Beggan, Ciaran","Chulliat, Amaud","Sabaka, Terence J.","Floberghagen, Rune","Friis-Christensen, Eigil","Kotsiaros, Stavros","Tøffner-Clausen, Lars"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-314214"],"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","cluster_size":1,"continent":["America, North","Europe, EU","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"country":["France","Germany","Italy","United Kingdom","United States"],"glorg":["All Global Affiliations","British Geological Survey","Directorate of Earth Observation Programmes","Helmholtz Centre Potsdam - German Research Centre for Geosciences","National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","Planetary Geodynamics Laboratory","Université Paris Cité"],"keyword":["Earth´s magnetic field","Swarm satellites"],"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-DTU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the swarm initial field model for the 000000002014 geomagnetic field","src":["dtu"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/2014GL062659","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-314214","identifier":[{"id":"84924856647","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-20668a3b-63e0-4bba-b55a-66646b7666d4"],"keyword":["Earth's magnetic Field","Geomagnetic model","Swarm satellites"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-F3CC6F1946464BD333BE751A89F1304D"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1002/2014GL062659","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Unused","mra":["Science / Technology (SCI)"],"yearPub":"2015","yearSub":"2015"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute","Technical University of Denmark, National Space Institute, Geomagnetism"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"fr","key":"université paris cité","loc":["France","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Université Paris Cité","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"de","key":"helmholtz centre potsdam german research centre for geosciences","loc":["Germany","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Helmholtz Centre Potsdam - German Research Centre for Geosciences","used":1},{"affno":"4","country":"gb","key":"british geological survey","loc":["United Kingdom","Europe, Non-EU","OECD"],"name":"British Geological Survey","used":1},{"affno":"5","country":"us","key":"national oceanic and atmospheric administration","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration","used":1},{"affno":"6","country":"us","key":"planetary geodynamics laboratory","loc":["United States","America, North","OECD"],"name":"Planetary Geodynamics Laboratory","used":1},{"affno":"7","country":"it","key":"directorate of earth observation programmes","loc":["Italy","Europe, EU","OECD"],"name":"Directorate of Earth Observation Programmes","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Nils","key":"olsenpau","last":"Olsen","locid":"120835d5-6d71-4847-8717-0215c74f8f3c","name":"Olsen, Nils","orcid":"0000-0003-1132-6113","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Gauthier","key":"hulotpau","last":"Hulot","name":"Hulot, Gauthier","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Vincent","key":"lesurpau","last":"Lesur","name":"Lesur, Vincent","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Chris","key":"finlaypau","last":"Finlay","locid":"b78cb787-4551-47bc-a890-fd37a7c3f217","name":"Finlay, Chris","orcid":"0000-0002-4592-2290","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4","corresponding":null,"first":"Ciaran","key":"begganpau","last":"Beggan","name":"Beggan, Ciaran","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"5","corresponding":null,"first":"Amaud","key":"chulliatpau","last":"Chulliat","name":"Chulliat, Amaud","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"6","corresponding":null,"first":"Terence J.","key":"sabakapau","last":"Sabaka","name":"Sabaka, Terence J.","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"7","corresponding":null,"first":"Rune","key":"floberghagenpau","last":"Floberghagen","name":"Floberghagen, Rune","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Eigil","key":"friischristensenpau","last":"Friis-Christensen","locid":"f703172b-70ff-44c7-82e4-68c57d77d965","name":"Friis-Christensen, Eigil","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Stavros","key":"kotsiarospau","last":"Kotsiaros",