{"abstract":"Sleep analysis is an important diagnostic tool for sleep disorders. However, the current manual sleep scoring is time-consuming as it is a crude discretization in time and stages. This study changes Esbroeck and Westover's [1] latent sleep staging model into a global model. The proposed data-driven method trained a topic mixture model on 10 control subjects and was applied on 10 other control subjects, 10 iRBD patients and 10 Parkinson's patients. In that way 30 topic mixture diagrams were obtained from which features reflecting distinct sleep architectures between control subjects and patients were extracted. Two features calculated on basis of two latent sleep states classified subjects as “control” or “patient” by a simple clustering algorithm. The mean sleep staging accuracy compared to classical AASM scoring was 72.4% for control subjects and a clustering of the derived features resulted in a sensitivity of 95% and a specificity of 80%. This study demonstrates that frequency analysis of sleep EEG can be used for data-driven global sleep classification and that topic features separates iRBD and Parkinson's patients from control subjects.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Koch, Henriette","Christensen, Julie Anja Engelhard","Frandsen, Rune","Arvastson, Lars Johan","Christensen, Søren Ro","Sørensen, Helge Bjarup Dissing","Jennum, Poul"],"cuid":["S02-083.34-034391"],"event":{"end":"2013-07-07","place":"Osaka, jp","start":"2013-07-03","title":"2013 35th Annual International Conference of the IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Diseases","Electroencephalography","Engineered Materials Dielectrics and Plasmas","Feature extraction","Medical disorders","Pattern clustering","Sleep","medical signal processing","signal classification"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-LUND"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-PR-LUND","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"classification of irbd and parkinson s patients using a general data driven sleep staging model built on eeg","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EMBC.2013.6610490","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-083.34-034391","identifier":[{"id":"24110677","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84886522903","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-504c9cb5-df0d-4b40-adde-79512b30f40e","ku-3a1ba17c-e9c6-4802-b66c-16cd5bebefcc"],"keyword":["Engineered Materials, Dielectrics and Plasmas","diseases","electroencephalography","feature extraction","medical disorders","medical signal processing","pattern clustering","signal classification","sleep"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-99F965FFBA3C263A7039A1E065EE38DF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EMBC.2013.6610490","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","country":"dk","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark"],"nora_code":"DI-U-DTU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"capital region of denmark","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-CAP","l3nl":"Capital Region of Denmark","l3nn":"Capital Region of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Capital Region of Denmark","namevar":["Copenhagen University Hospital Herlev and Gentofte"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-CAP","used":1},{"affno":"3","country":"dk","key":"lundbeck","l2":"DI-PR","l2n":"Private Research","l3":"DI-PR-LUND","l3nl":"Lundbeck Pharma","l3nn":"Lundbeck","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"Lundbeck","namevar":["H. Lundbeck A/S"],"nora_code":"DI-PR-LUND","used":1},{"affno":"4","key":"ku university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-KU","l3nl":"University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"KU University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"KU University of Copenhagen","namevar":["Københavns Universitet, Faculty of Health and Medical Sciences, Department of Clinical Medicine, Section of Neurology, Psychiatry and Sensory Sciences"],"nora_code":"DI-U-KU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Henriette","key":"kochhenriettepau","last":"Koch","name":"Koch, Henriette","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Julie Anja Engelhard","key":"christensenjulieanjaengelhardpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"5201365e-8d40-4d6b-af99-026b1108b5e9","name":"Christensen, Julie Anja Engelhard","orcid":"0000-0003-4225-3359","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Gitte Julie","key":"christensengittejuliepau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Gitte Julie","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"2","corresponding":null,"first":"Rune","key":"frandsenrunepau","last":"Frandsen","name":"Frandsen, Rune","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Rune Asger Vestergaard","key":"frandsenruneasgervestergaardpau","last":"Frandsen","name":"Frandsen, Rune Asger Vestergaard","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Lars Johan","key":"arvastsonlarsjohanpau","last":"Arvastson","locid":"d5cbd65e-7e62-4684-9fd4-8401893e739a","name":"Arvastson, Lars Johan","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Lars","key":"arvastsonlarspau","last":"Arvastson","name":"Arvastson, Lars","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Søren Ro","key":"christensensørenropau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Søren Ro","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Soren R","key":"christensensorenrpau","last":"Christensen","name":"Christensen, Soren R","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"country":"dk","first":"Helge Bjarup Dissing","key":"sørensenhelgebjarupdissingpau","last":"Sørensen","locid":"be0efdb7-17ce-4703-b513-90dfa28f45af","name":"Sørensen, Helge Bjarup Dissing","orcid":"0000-0001-5716-7600","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","first":"Helge B D","key":"sorensenhelgebdpau","last":"Sorensen","name":"Sorensen, Helge B D","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"4 2","first":"Poul","key":"jennumpoulpau","last":"Jennum","locid":"09499315-7437-47b1-a859-6783b0dd67c1","name":"Jennum, Poul","orcid":"0000-0001-6986-5254","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["24110677"],"pub":{"doi":"10.1109/embc.2013.6610490","isbn":["9781457702167"],"issn":["1557170X","23757477"],"issn_org":["23757477"],"journal":"IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society. Conference Proceedings","pages":"4275-4278","status":"p","title":"IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society. Conference Proceedings","title_org":"I E E E Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society. Conference Proceedings","volume":"2013"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84886522903"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Hospitals","All Private Research","All Universities","Capital Region of Denmark","DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-HO-ALL","DI-PR","DI-PR-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","Hospitals","Lundbeck Pharma","Private Research","Technical University of Denmark","Universities","University of Copenhagen"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["dtu-504c9cb5-df0d-4b40-adde-79512b30f40e","ku-3a1ba17c-e9c6-4802-b66c-16cd5bebefcc"],"src":["DTU Technical University of Denmark","KU University of Copenhagen"],"title":"Classification of iRBD and Parkinson's patients using a general data-driven sleep staging model built on EEG","type":"Journal Article","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S02-083.34-034391","year":"2013","yearsub":"2013"}
{"abstract":"Patients suffering from the sleep disorder idiopathic rapid-eye-movement sleep behavior disorder (iRBD) have been observed to be in high risk of developing Parkinson's disease (PD). This makes it essential to analyze them in the search for PD biomarkers. This study aims at classifying patients suffering from iRBD or PD based on features reflecting eye movements (EMs) during sleep. A Latent Dirichlet Allocation (LDA) topic model was developed based on features extracted from two electrooculographic (EOG) signals measured as parts in full night polysomnographic (PSG) recordings from ten control subjects. The trained model was tested on ten other control subjects, ten iRBD patients and ten PD patients, obtaining a EM topic mixture diagram for each subject in the test dataset. Three features were extracted from the topic mixture diagrams, reflecting “certainty”, “fragmentation” and “stability” in the timely distribution of the EM topics. Using a Naive Bayes (NB) classifier and the features “certainty” and “stability” yielded the best classification result and the subjects were classified with a sensitivity of 95 %, a specificity of 80% and an accuracy of 90 %. This study demonstrates in a data-driven approach, that iRBD and PD patients may exhibit abnorm form and/or timely distribution of EMs during sleep.","author_count":12,"contributors":["Christensen, Julie Anja Engelhard","Koch, Henriette","Frandsen, Rune","Kempfner, Jacob","Arvastson, Lars Johan","Christensen, Søren Ro","Sørensen, Helge Bjarup Dissing","Jennum, Poul"],"cuid":["S02-085.94-036074"],"event":{"end":"2013-07-07","place":"Osaka, jp","start":"2013-07-03","title":"2013 35th Annual International Conference of the IEEE Engineering in Medicine and Biology Society","year":"2013"},"filters":{"added":"2021-12","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"11-50 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"keyword":["Bayes methods","Diseases","Engineered Materials Dielectrics and Plasmas","Feature extraction","Medical disorders","Sleep","electro oculography","medical signal processing","signal classification"],"level":"sci","mra":["med","sci"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"Yes","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-PR","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-CAP"],"PR":["DI-PR-ALL","DI-PR-LUND"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-CAP","DI-PR-LUND","DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"classification of irbd and parkinson s disease patients based on eye movements during sleep","src":["dtu","ku"],"src-code":["DI-U-DTU","DI-U-KU"],"type":"dcp","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EMBC.2013.6609531","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-085.94-036074","identifier":[{"id":"24109718","type":"pmid"},{"id":"84886571041","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["dtu-991929d6-70dc-41bd-bf82-f26818fae345","ku-d5f8415e-e2ba-45f6-ba2a-a796a2d7fa80"],"keyword":["Bayes methods","Engineered Materials, Dielectrics and Plasmas","diseases","electro-oculography","feature extraction","medical disorders","medical signal processing","signal classification","sleep"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science","Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-F08F935A8D0611B9651739FD8CF0E691"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1109/EMBC.2013.6609531","version":"Other Version"}],"oai":{"class":"Blocked","mra":["Medicine (MED)"],"yearPub":"2013","yearSub":"2013"},"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"dtu technical university of denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-DTU","l3nl":"Technical University of Denmark","l3nn":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"DTU Technical University of Denmark","namevar":["Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering","Technical University of Denmark, Department of Electrical Engineering, Biomedical Engineering"],"nora_code":"DI