{"author_count":1,"contributors":["Christensen, Lars Rune"],"cuid":["S01-000.00-382480"],"event":{"end":"2012-06-01","place":"Marseilles, fr","start":"2012-05-29","title":"10th International Conference on the Design of Cooperative Systems","year":"2012"},"filters":{"added":"2024-06","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"1 contributor","cluster_size":1,"level":"sci","mra":["sci"],"oa":"Undetermined","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-U"],"level3":{"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-ITU"]},"level3all":["DI-U-ITU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"the trouble with knowledge transfer on conduit metaphors and semantic pathologies in our understanding of didactic practice","src":["itu"],"src-code":["DI-U-ITU"],"type":"dba","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"un","type":"url","url":"https://www.scopus.com/pages/publications/84887113626","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S01-000.00-382480","identifier":[{"id":"84887113626","type":"scopus"}],"ids":["itu-50f9dfca-9e0e-47d1-95bd-cc1303da1869"],"lang":"Danish","level":"Scientific","mra":["Science/Technology"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-4-FDA83C92C93434B6DA86F07B0FB8DB98"],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"itu it university of copenhagen","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-ITU","l3nl":"IT University of Copenhagen","l3nn":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"ITU IT University of Copenhagen","namevar":["IT University of Copenhagen, Business IT","IT University of Copenhagen, Technologies in Practice, Technologies in Practice","The Department, Culture, Aesthetics, Organisations and Society"],"nora_code":"DI-U-ITU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Lars Rune","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"92f6c3f3-0ad2-40fc-b278-69170f87567d","name":"Christensen, Lars Rune","orcid":"0000-0001-7204-465X","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pub":{"isbn":["9781447140924"],"pages":"111-121","publisher":"Springer","status":"p","subtitle":"Proceedings of the 10th International Conference on the Design of Cooperative Systems, May 30 - 1 June, 2012","title":"From Research to Practice in the Design of Cooperative Systems: Results and Open Challenges"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84887113626"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["itu-50f9dfca-9e0e-47d1-95bd-cc1303da1869"],"src":["ITU IT University of Copenhagen"],"title":"The Trouble with ‘Knowledge Transfer’: On Conduit Metaphors and Semantic Pathologies in Our Understanding of Didactic Practice","type":"Book Chapter","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-382480","year":"2012","yearsub":"2012"}
{"abstract":"3.0Tesla magnetic resonance imaging (MRI) with diffusion-weighted imaging (DWI) was compared with combined 18F-fluorodeoxyglucose positron emission tomography and computed tomography (PET/CT) in patients with suspected bone metastases from breast cancer. A prospective clinical study was performed in 13 female breast cancer patients (mean age 61years; range 45-85 years). The spine was imaged in the sagittal plane with T1-weighted (T1), short tau inversion recovery (STIR), and T2-weighted fat-saturated (T2) sequences. The pelvis was imaged similarly in the coronal plane. Axial DWI was performed from the skull base to the mid-thigh. MRI and PET/CT were performed in all patients at a maximum interval of 10 working days and at least 14 days after chemotherapy. MRI was reviewed by two radiologists, and their consensus on potential metastases in 27 predefined locations was recorded. The predefined locations were the vertebral bodies (24), the left (1) and right (1) pelvic bones, and the sacral bone (1). The PET/CT was reviewed by a radiologists and a nuclear medicine physician. MRI detected 59 of the 60 active metastases found with our gold standard modality PET/CT. T1 had the highest sensitivity (98%) but rather low specificity (77%), but with the addition of STIR and DWI, the specificity increased to 95%. The additional metastases detected with MRI most likely represented postherapeutic residual scars without active tumour. In conclusion, 3.0Tesla MRI with T1, STIR, and DWI is useful for the clinical evaluation of bone metastases from breast cancer and compares well to PET/CT.","author_count":9,"contributors":["Grankvist, J","Fisker, Rune Vincents","Iyer, Victor Vishwanath","Fründ, Ernst-Torben","Simonsen, Carsten W","Christensen, T.","Stenbygaard, Lars E","Ewertz, Marianne","Larsson, E-M"],"cuid":["S02-080.00-025543"],"filters":{"added":"2021-10","altsrc":["Global Data"],"author_count":"6-10 contributors","class":"merged","cluster_size":2,"level":"sci","mra":["med"],"oa":"Open Access","oaiscope":"No","org":{"level1":["di"],"level2":["DI-ALL","DI-HO","DI-U"],"level3":{"HO":["DI-HO-ALL","DI-HO-NDR"],"U":["DI-U-ALL","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"level3all":["DI-HO-NDR","DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"]},"review":"pr","rtype":["clu"],"sorti":"mri and pet ct of patients with bone metastases from breast carcinoma","src":["au","sdu"],"src-code":["DI-U-AU","DI-U-SDU"],"type":"dja","type-grp":["all","pub"]},"ft":{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejrad.2010.10.024","version":"Other Version"},"id":"S02-080.00-025543","identifier":[{"id":"84855564244","type":"scopus"},{"id":"21227614","type":"pmid"}],"ids":["au-b0a241fc-6f2e-401c-83f8-71402e1a4f0b","sdu-4226f5ae-23a6-4006-a68e-61121a0b5f38"],"lang":"English","level":"Scientific","mra":["Medical Science"],"noi":["Global-Local-2-5-05B9065786D9090F68BEF824F6F296CF"],"oa_link":[{"access":"oa","type":"doi","url":"https://doi.org/10.1016/j.ejrad.2010.10.024","version":"Other Version"}],"org":[{"affno":"1","key":"au aarhus university","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-AU","l3nl":"Aarhus University","l3nn":"AU Aarhus University","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"AU Aarhus University","namevar":["Aarhus University, Health, Department of Clinical Medicine, Department of Clinical Medicine - Radiologisk afdeling, Aalborg Sygehus"],"nora_code":"DI-U-AU","used":1},{"affno":"2","country":"dk","key":"north denmark region","l2":"DI-HO","l2n":"Hospitals","l3":"DI-HO-NDR","l3nl":"North Denmark Region","l3nn":"North Denmark Region","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"North Denmark Region","namevar":["Aalborg University Hospital"],"nora_code":"DI-HO-NDR","used":1},{"affno":"3","key":"sdu university of southern denmark","l2":"DI-U","l2n":"Universities","l3":"DI-U-SDU","l3nl":"University of Southern Denmark","l3nn":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","loc":["Denmark","Europe, EU","Nordic","OECD"],"name":"SDU University of Southern Denmark","namevar":["SDU, The Faculty of Health Sciences, Department of Clinical Research, KI, OUH, Research unit of Oncology (Odense)"],"nora_code":"DI-U-SDU","used":1}],"person":[{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"J","key":"grankvistpau","last":"Grankvist","locid":"3f3109f3-9cb8-475a-9517-daf0c71e254f","name":"Grankvist, J","rank":1,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"R","key":"fiskerpau","last":"Fisker","locid":"a51c5246-2f4f-404a-8d3e-3ffc345c9d17","name":"Fisker, Rune Vincents","name_org":"Fisker, R","rank":2,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"V","key":"iyerpau","last":"Iyer","locid":"fee4ce64-cb95-4e9f-9d63-b29cc05ce14c","name":"Iyer, Victor Vishwanath","name_org":"Iyer, V","rank":3,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"E T","key":"fründpau","last":"Fründ","locid":"76afe456-2abe-4508-85e5-1595f47c0d52","name":"Fründ, Ernst-Torben","name_org":"Fründ, E T","rank":4,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"Carsten","key":"simonsenpau","last":"Simonsen","locid":"73642d7e-15e1-489d-a702-fb7dfe7fbbac","name":"Simonsen, Carsten W","name_org":"Simonsen, Carsten","rank":5,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1","corresponding":null,"first":"T.","key":"christensenpau","last":"Christensen","locid":"f959fc9d-0fef-49a7-a989-b35a084aef40","name":"Christensen, T.","rank":6,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"1 2","corresponding":null,"first":"L","key":"stenbygaardpau","last":"Stenbygaard","locid":"8b578d8b-a696-4e5d-9136-e9a9c1b0c95c","name":"Stenbygaard, Lars E","name_org":"Stenbygaard, L","rank":7,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"3","corresponding":null,"first":"Marianne","key":"ewertzpau","last":"Ewertz","locid":"d801b1dd-5a14-4570-857b-805f8056eee2","name":"Ewertz, Marianne","orcid":"0000-0002-5965-969X","rank":8,"rolecode":"pau"},{"affno":"","corresponding":null,"first":"E-M","key":"larssonpau","last":"Larsson","name":"Larsson, E-M","rank":9,"rolecode":"pau"}],"pmid":["21227614"],"pub":{"doi":"10.